    "id": "p07",
    "number": "07",
    "categoryId": "review",
    "categoryName": "Review & Quality Assurance",
    "title": "Style Guide Compliance Report",
    "useCase": "Audit documentation against your company style guide with a scored compliance report",
    "level": "Intermediate",
    "badgeColor": "#f59e0b",
    "promptText": "You are a Principal Technical Editor and style guide enforcement auditor.\n\nAudit the following technical documentation draft against the <mark>[STYLE GUIDE NAME, e.g., Microsoft Writing Style Guide / Google Developer Documentation Style Guide / Company Internal Style Guide]</mark>.\n\n&lt;input_sources&gt;\nAttached documents (recommended):\n- Attach your documentation draft (.md or .docx) and your custom style guide document (.pdf or .md) if available.\n- Or paste the documentation draft to audit here:\n<mark>[PASTE DRAFT DOCUMENTATION TEXT HERE]</mark>\n&lt;/input_sources&gt;\n\n&lt;parameters&gt;\n- Style standard: <mark>[e.g., Microsoft Writing Style Guide / Google Developer Style Guide / Company Standard]</mark>\n- Target audience: <mark>[TARGET AUDIENCE]</mark>\n- Primary goals: Consistency, accessibility, active voice, sentence case, and conciseness.\n&lt;/parameters&gt;\n\n&lt;instructions&gt;\n1. Audit the text thoroughly across the following dimensions:\n   - Voice and Tone: Warm, relaxed, crisp, approachable, second-person ('you').\n   - Structure &amp; Headings: Sentence-style capitalization, parallel imperative headings.\n   - Language Mechanics: Active voice percentage, sentence length under 25 words, elimination of jargon and filler words.\n   - Punctuation &amp; Formatting: Proper list punctuation, serial commas, no em-dashes.\n   - Accessibility: Descriptive hyperlinks, accessible visual references.\n2. Produce a comprehensive audit report with:\n   - Overall Compliance Score (0 to 100).\n   - Executive Summary of top 3 recurring style issues.\n   - Detailed Findings Table: Excerpt | Violation | Rule Reference | Recommended Fix.\n   - Fully Revised Document incorporating all corrections while preserving original technical facts.\n&lt;/instructions&gt;\n\n&lt;output_format&gt;\nOutput the compliance report followed by the fully corrected document in Markdown.\n&lt;/output_format&gt;",
    "copyPrompt": "You are a Principal Technical Editor and style guide enforcement auditor.\n\nAudit the following technical documentation draft against the [STYLE GUIDE NAME, e.g., Microsoft Writing Style Guide / Google Developer Documentation Style Guide / Company Internal Style Guide].\n\n<input_sources>\nAttached documents (recommended):\n- Attach your documentation draft (.md or .docx) and your custom style guide document (.pdf or .md) if available.\n- Or paste the documentation draft to audit here:\n[PASTE DRAFT DOCUMENTATION TEXT HERE]\n</input_sources>\n\n<parameters>\n- Style standard: [e.g., Microsoft Writing Style Guide / Google Developer Style Guide / Company Standard]\n- Target audience: [TARGET AUDIENCE]\n- Primary goals: Consistency, accessibility, active voice, sentence case, and conciseness.\n</parameters>\n\n<instructions>\n1. Audit the text thoroughly across the following dimensions:\n   - Voice and Tone: Warm, relaxed, crisp, approachable, second-person ('you').\n   - Structure & Headings: Sentence-style capitalization, parallel imperative headings.\n   - Language Mechanics: Active voice percentage, sentence length under 25 words, elimination of jargon and filler words.\n   - Punctuation & Formatting: Proper list punctuation, serial commas, no em-dashes.\n   - Accessibility: Descriptive hyperlinks, accessible visual references.\n2. Produce a comprehensive audit report with:\n   - Overall Compliance Score (0 to 100).\n   - Executive Summary of top 3 recurring style issues.\n   - Detailed Findings Table: Excerpt | Violation | Rule Reference | Recommended Fix.\n   - Fully Revised Document incorporating all corrections while preserving original technical facts.\n</instructions>\n\n<output_format>\nOutput the compliance report followed by the fully corrected document in Markdown.\n</output_format>",
    "proTip": "Attach both your draft file and your company style guide document. The AI will cross-reference rules and produce a line-by-line audit.",
